---
- op: replace
  path: /metadata/name
  value: mcp-hindsight-others
- op: add
  path: /spec/toolsOverride
  value:
    retain:
      description: >-
        Store a derived memory that fits neither the persona nor the work bank.
        Prefer an explicit bank when one applies. NEVER retain credentials,
        secrets, raw tool dumps, or verbatim log payloads; distill first. Tag
        consistently using existing tags (see list_tags).
    recall:
      description: >-
        Search catch-all memories. Prefer reflect for synthesized answers; use
        recall only when individual memory entries are needed.
